"""
============================================================
  Phase Field Crystal (PFC) Simulation — Upgraded
  Crystal Growth with Stochastic Noise + Dataset Generation

  Based on: elvissoares/PyPFC (github.com/elvissoares/PyPFC)
  Modified by: Ayush Shah & Tobias Li
